Modules for Experiments in Stellar Astrophysics (MESA) grids. For a standard
$1.0\,M_{\odot}$ solar calibration model, the solver matches core conditions:
\begin{equation}
\rho_{c} \approx \rho_{c,\odot},
\qquad
T_{c} \approx T_{c,\odot},
\end{equation}
with boundary luminosity and opacity profiles consistent with the adopted stellar model.

\subsubsection{Tokamak Diagnostic Telemetry (MHD Baseline)}
